WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.421
A whole week went by.

2
00:00:04.422 --> 00:00:08.408
Vinnie and Mandy could not go to the attic.

3
00:00:08.409 --> 00:00:13.248
Mom and Dad kept them busy all the time.

4
00:00:13.249 --> 00:00:18.157
On Saturday morning, Vinnie and Mandy got their chance.

5
00:00:18.158 --> 00:00:21.710
Vinnie woke his sister up.

6
00:00:21.711 --> 00:00:24.898
It was still dark.

7
00:00:24.899 --> 00:00:28.073
"What time is it?"

8
00:00:28.074 --> 00:00:31.142
Mandy asked, rubbing her eyes.

9
00:00:31.143 --> 00:00:32.893
"It doesn’t matter.

10
00:00:32.894 --> 00:00:35.816
Come on," Vinnie whispered.

11
00:00:35.817 --> 00:00:39.409
The children crept up the stairs.

12
00:00:39.410 --> 00:00:42.736
Mandy opened the photo album.

13
00:00:42.737 --> 00:00:46.878
"Look at the Aztec photo," she said.

14
00:00:46.879 --> 00:00:48.759
Vinnie looked.

15
00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:52.268
"Yeah, that’s us!" he said.

16
00:00:52.269 --> 00:00:56.821
He shivered as he remembered their Aztec travels.

17
00:00:56.822 --> 00:01:02.623
"Where will we go next?" he wondered aloud.

18
00:01:02.624 --> 00:01:05.960
Mandy turned the page.

19
00:01:05.961 --> 00:01:12.245
This time the old man stood in front of a very long ship.

20
00:01:12.246 --> 00:01:15.517
The ship had a huge sail.

21
00:01:15.518 --> 00:01:17.910
It glowed brightly.

22
00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:23.700
Along the side of the ship were 16 large round plates.

23
00:01:23.701 --> 00:01:28.432
They were glowing too.

24
00:01:28.433 --> 00:01:33.168
"What is this?" Vinnie pulled the picture out.

25
00:01:33.169 --> 00:01:36.152
He stared at the glowing photo.

26
00:01:36.153 --> 00:01:39.911
"It looks like . . ." Mandy began.

27
00:01:39.912 --> 00:01:45.601
She couldn’t finish her sentence.

28
00:01:45.602 --> 00:01:50.814
The children fell into the dark tunnel.

29
00:01:50.815 --> 00:01:56.481
"Ow!" grunted Vinnie as he landed on a wooden floor.

30
00:01:56.482 --> 00:02:00.925
"Ugh!" groaned Mandy. "That hurt.

31
00:02:00.926 --> 00:02:03.221
Where are we?"

32
00:02:03.222 --> 00:02:06.883
The children sat up and looked around.

33
00:02:06.884 --> 00:02:11.423
They were surrounded by wooden chests.

34
00:02:11.424 --> 00:02:15.400
A chilly breeze brushed their faces.

35
00:02:15.401 --> 00:02:18.575
They were rocking gently.

36
00:02:18.576 --> 00:02:23.478
"I think we’re on a ship," whispered Vinnie.

37
00:02:23.479 --> 00:02:27.116
The ship suddenly moved up and down. Vinnie

38
00:02:27.117 --> 00:02:29.486
lost his balance. "Whoa!"

39
00:02:29.487 --> 00:02:32.070
he cried. He

40
00:02:32.071 --> 00:02:37.814
fell backward, flinging his arms wildly. "Ouch!

41
00:02:37.815 --> 00:02:42.172
You hit me," said a voice. A

42
