boy slowly sat up, rubbing his arm. Startled,

43
00:02:47.239 --> 00:02:51.207
the children stared at him. The

44
00:02:51.208 --> 00:02:55.078
boy’s fair hair and skin were dirty. He

45
00:02:55.079 --> 00:03:01.899
wore a pair of dark pants, fur boots, and a wool cloak. "Where

46
00:03:01.900 --> 00:03:06.080
did you come from?" the boy asked. "We

47
00:03:06.081 --> 00:03:10.412
. . . " Vinnie struggled to answer. Mandy

48
00:03:10.413 --> 00:03:13.614
got up and looked around. They

49
00:03:13.615 --> 00:03:17.426
were on a large open boat. There

50
00:03:17.427 --> 00:03:23.141
were many wooden benches along both sides of the ship. About

51
