men were sleeping on the benches, snoring loudly. One

53
00:03:33.575 --> 00:03:39.284
very large man was snoring louder than all of them. "Hey—you're

54
00:03:39.285 --> 00:03:42.165
a girl!" the

55
00:03:42.166 --> 00:03:46.538
boy suddenly said, staring at Mandy. "So

56
00:03:46.539 --> 00:03:50.561
what?" Mandy replied loudly. "Shh,

57
00:03:50.562 --> 00:03:54.748
be quiet," said the boy. "You’ll

58
00:03:54.749 --> 00:03:57.602
wake him up." "Who?"

59
00:03:57.603 --> 00:04:01.738
asked Mandy, turning quickly. As

60
00:04:01.739 --> 00:04:06.137
she turned, she knocked over a bag. It

61
