nails scattered loudly all over the wooden deck. "Him?"

63
00:04:16.298 --> 00:04:21.899
Vinnie asked, pointing to the large man. "Uh-oh,

64
00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:24.092
too late. He’s

65
00:04:24.093 --> 00:04:26.541
already awake." The

66
